[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:55. The Sawyer Family]
[00:00.860]Lesson 55 | 第55课
[00:02.990]The Sawyers live at 87 King Street. | 索耶一家住在国王街87号。
[00:07.410]In the morning, Mr. Sawyer goes to work, and the children go to school. | 早上，索耶先生去上班，孩子们去上学。
[00:13.660]Their father takes them to school every day. | 他们的父亲每天送他们去上学。
[00:18.270]Mrs. Sawyer stays at home every day. | 索耶太太每天待在家里。
[00:22.330]She does the housework. | 她做家务。
[00:25.035]She always eats her lunch at noon. | 她总是在中午吃午饭。
[00:29.815]In the afternoon, she usually sees her friends. | 下午，她通常会见她的朋友。
[00:35.045]They often drink tea together. | 他们经常一起喝茶。
[00:38.690]In the evening, the children come home from school. | 晚上，孩子们放学回家。
[00:43.655]They arrive home early. | 他们早早到家。
[00:46.835]Mr. Sawyer comes home from work. | 索耶先生下班回家。
[00:50.780]He arrives home late. | 他到家很晚。
[00:54.005]At night, the children always do their homework. | 晚上，孩子们总是做作业。
[00:58.960]Then they go to bed. | 然后他们上床睡觉。
[01:01.480]Mr. Sawyer usually reads his newspaper. | 索耶先生通常会读报纸。
[01:05.290]But sometimes he and his wife watch television. | 但有时他和他的妻子会看电视。